# Claude Code / Codex: shared project config is committed (CLAUDE.md,
# AGENTS.md, .claude/settings.json); per-machine overrides are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Skills installed by the plugin manager — somebody else's documentation, in
# two copies, and not this project's to carry. The lockfile beside them *is*
# committed: it names the source and the hash, so the content is
# reinstallable and the version is recorded. Vendoring the pages themselves
# would mean hand-carrying their updates forever.
#
# `.agents/` is where the installer puts them; `.claude/skills/` is the copy
# Claude Code actually reads.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
